as you search for survivors, uncovering the source of the calamity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122000/extras/2e95b032a4e3a882b726853bd8de6a48.poster.avif?t=1754759644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122000/extras/2e95b032a4e3a882b726853bd8de6a48.webm?t=1754759644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122000/extras/2e95b032a4e3a882b726853bd8de6a48.mp4?t=1754759644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122000/extras/bc0c09d00e9cbe47f278c28d127b526e.poster.avif?t=1754759644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122000/extras/bc0c09d00e9cbe47f278c28d127b526e.webm?t=1754759644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122000/extras/bc0c09d00e9cbe47f278c28d127b526e.mp4?t=1754759644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
